            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "One thing I noticed while revisiting adjacent functionality (in particular, #841 for 'mini.ai'), is that it is possible to do with `<C-j>` key which *indeed* represents new line character instead of `<CR>` / `'\\r'` which is a carriage return. But that still won't have good support for indentation.",
